{
  "justification": "The electorate prioritises material well-being and security (living costs top, health notable) while showing a slightly right-of-centre stance with modest support for redistribution and a distinctly more authoritarian mean on the authority-liberty scale. Immigration is highly salient and European integration sits slightly below neutral, indicating in-group/sovereignty concerns, while there is little direct evidence on purity-based morality.",
